comic-identify (0.41.1-1ubuntu1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Packaging: the package now passes lintian with no errors, warnings
    or notes. Add debian/copyright and changelog.Debian.gz, and manual
    pages in English and Spanish.
  * Install the application in /usr/share/comic-identify instead of
    /opt/comic-identify.
  * Add Keywords to the desktop entry and use only the Graphics
    category.
  * Fix file permissions in the package, independent of the umask used
    to build it.
  * Add a CI workflow (tests, ruff and lintian on the .deb) and status
    badges in the READMEs.

 -- Jose Antonio Seguido Doblado <jose.antonio.seguido@gmail.com>  Fri, 02 Oct 2026 02:05:36 +0200

